            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "High-frequency FIB and environmental data collected and collated during the Pillar Point Harbor Study (August 1-3, 2022). Samples were collected once per 30 minutes. Data from a sub-study, collected at 1 minute intervals for 30 minutes totals, are also included.",
